OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murder after victim
OL,4,Adies 15 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of murder
OL,7,Fafter his victim suffered an epileptic
OL,8,Ffit and died 15 years after being
OL,9,Fassaulted in Lewisham, south-east
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FJordan Burton, now aged 33, was aged 14
OL,13,Fwhen he caused a serious head injury to
OL,14,FDaniel Allright, who was 16 at the
OL,15,Ftime.
OL,17,FThe court heard Allright suffered his
OL,18,Ffirst seizure six months after the
OL,19,Fattack in September 2006, and was
OL,20,Fprescribed medication, but his epilepsy
OL,21,Fworsened in the months before his
OL,22,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
